 </span><span begin="00:42.672" end="00:43.216">read </span><span begin="00:43.216" end="00:43.576">your </span><span begin="00:43.576" end="00:44.280">mind </span><span begin="00:44.280" end="00:45.016">already</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.336" end="00:48.296"><span begin="00:45.336" end="00:45.840">Oh </span><span begin="00:45.840" end="00:46.312">so </span><span begin="00:46.312" end="00:46.712">full </span><span begin="00:46.712" end="00:47.000">of </span><span begin="00:47.000" end="00:47.536">new </span><span begin="00:47.536" end="00:48.296">ideas</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.752" end="00:51.769"><span begin="00:48.752" end="00:49.120">Is </span><span begin="00:49.120" end="00:49.512">this </span><span begin="00:49.512" end="00:49.904">what </span><span begin="00:49.904" end="00:50.304">we </span><span begin="00:50.304" end="00:50.608">were </span><span begin="00:50.608" end="00:50.896">meant </span><span begin="00:50.896" end="00:51.296">to </span><span begin="00:51.296" end="00:51.769">be</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.272" end="00:55.056"><span begin="00:52.272" end="00:52.672">Just </span><span begin="00:52.672" end="00:53.456">exactly </span><span begin="00:53.456" end="00:53.776">what </span><span begin="00:53.776" end="00:54.376">you </span><span begin="00:54.376" end="00:55.056">need</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.335" end="00:59.471"><span begin="00:55.335" end="00:55.847">So </span><span begin="00:55.847" end="00:56.159">if </span><span begin="00:56.159" end="00:56.487">you </span><span begin="00:56.487" end="00:57.119">ask </span><span begin="00:57.119" end="00:59.471">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.759" end="01:02.711"><span begin="00:59.759" end="01:00.153">How </span><span begin="01:00.153" end="01:00.615">I've </span><span begin="01:00.615" end="01:02.711">been</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.127" end="01:04.615"><span begin="01:03.127" end="01:03.463">I'm </span><span begin="01: